  "scope": "Fixed16 TRAIN batches, M95 eval forward, 33 recoverable failures. cos_query_* is the cosine between the final query embedding that the referent head actually reads for the query covering the target and for the deployed argmax query. cos_region_* does the same for sigmoid-mask-weighted pooled scene features. pos_distance is the difference between the two queries' positions, which the last decoder layer receives but does not use. If cos_query is close to 1 the referent head cannot in principle separate the pair. Diagnosis only.",
